Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.93,0:05:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第7季第15集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.97,0:00:03.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.38,0:00:05.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西方出现了一位新的领导者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a new leader rising in the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.87,0:00:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  是我  莉莉丝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Dean. It's me -- Lilith.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.59,0:00:10.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我不再喜欢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I like you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:17.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我将在你头脑里设一道屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna put up a barrier inside your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.45,0:00:19.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要碰这个屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't scratch the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.54,0:00:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我不是真实存在的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm not real,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.70,0:00:22.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我哪里也不去  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm not going anywhere, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.31,0:00:25.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.22,0:00:27.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们俩这辈子斗妖魔鬼怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you full up just playing snuffleupagus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.44,0:00:28.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不够烦的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the devil all the livelong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:29.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道  鲍比\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.88,0:00:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我倒无所谓老能看见路西法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing Lucifer's fine with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.83,0:00:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少我的疯狂还在一定范围之内\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least all my crazy's under one umbrella.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.71,0:00:39.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(四年前)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.76,0:00:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(爱达荷州  科达伦)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.13,0:00:59.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海夫洛克女士  你不该过来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Havelock, you shouldn't have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.50,0:01:05.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要亲眼见见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed to see it for myself --
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.20,0:01:07.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们千辛万苦才追踪到他  花了这么长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all that tracking, all those hours we spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.93,0:01:11.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通过书籍研究他们是一回事  但...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's one thing to study them in books. It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我闻到了绝经老女人的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I smell menopause?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:34.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不是西部的那个贱人巫士嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it isn't the wiccan bitch of the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.33,0:01:36.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,海夫洛克女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ms. Havelock,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.31,0:01:39.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道是你帮他们找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're the one that helped them find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.43,0:01:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.70,0:01:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但却没能及时救这个女孩的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not in time to save our big girl here,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.35,0:01:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你还是立了大功\N{\fnArial\fs30}but still, you get a merit badge.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.05,0:01:53.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们抓到你了  狗娘养的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They caught you, you son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.77,0:01:55.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没法再杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more murders!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.12,0:01:57.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且你就要重返地狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're going back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.64,0:02:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺拉  诺拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Nora, Nora...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.62,0:02:03.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会像掏空南瓜一样把你掏空\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna scoop you out like a pumpkin.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:05.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.81,0:02:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你掏人的日子结束了  笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, your, uh, scooping days are over, gomer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.48,0:02:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在唯一需要担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you got to worry about now...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.80,0:02:23.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}is us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.76,0:02:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经不是我们这次打猎抓到的第一个恶魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't the first demon we've tracked down on this safari.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.09,0:02:33.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  事实上\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. As a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.12,0:02:34.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得你已经是第七个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you put us over half a dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.76,0:02:37.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想找莉莉丝  你们根本没找对地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for Lilith in all the wrong places.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.34,0:02:39.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你得帮帮我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're gonna help us with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:42.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们要海扁他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If things are about to get messy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:46.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那也许你该见见这具肉身的主人\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you should meet the owner of this fleshy temple...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.77,0:02:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他乖得很\N{\fnArial\fs30}A puppy of a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们会喜欢他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:00.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里  杰弗里  是你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey? Jeffrey, is that you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.79,0:03:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们得阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.60,0:03:11.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的  我们会阻止他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will. We're going to, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:13.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把那个恶魔送回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna send that demon back to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.86,0:03:15.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托不要伤害我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't hurt me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.06,0:03:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里  在我们放他走之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey, before we can let him go...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.87,0:03:27.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个恶魔知道其他同类的下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the demon knows where we can find more of his kind, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.22,0:03:33.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在追捕他们  一个都不放\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, we're hunting them -- all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.55,0:03:36.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不会轻易把情报说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna give up his rolodex easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里  我们要拿刀割他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey, we're gonna have to cut into him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.81,0:03:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是割你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.43,0:03:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他逼我对那些女人下毒手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, the things he made me do to those women.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.69,0:04:01.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你们要对他做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you have to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.33,0:04:03.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽管动手就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.49,0:04:09.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托你们一定要阻止这个恶魔...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please just stop this evil piece of...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.84,0:04:15.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,絮絮叨叨  絮絮叨叨\N{\fnArial\fs30}And on and on and on.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说实话  一说起"善恶"什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frankly, he can get tedious
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.49,0:04:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就变得啰里啰嗦的\N{\fnArial\fs30}with this whole "good and evil" thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.55,0:04:23.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.51,0:04:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢杰弗里  他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like Jeffrey. He's a decent guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.31,0:04:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  他刚把肉身交给我们处置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, he just signed off on his temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.09,0:04:55.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她还有其他手下  我们已经知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's got other lieutenants. We already know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.93,0:04:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把名字告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want names.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.21,0:05:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.32,0:05:12.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫麦瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Merrick!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.19,0:05:13.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:16.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们能在新奥尔良找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find him in New Orleans!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.40,0:05:20.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.76,0:05:25.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:41.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.04,0:05:43.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里  你醒了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey, you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.29,0:05:47.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你刚才晕过去了  你休克了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you passed out. You're in shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:49.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他走了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's -- he's gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.69,0:05:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们把他驱走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We exorcised him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.68,0:05:52.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尽量别动  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to move, okay? 
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:54.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们快到医院了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're almost to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.57,0:05:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your... your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我弟弟留在犯罪现场清除我们的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother stayed back to clean us out of that crime scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.11,0:06:04.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没必要为杀掉恶魔坐牢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no reason to go down for a demon's murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.06,0:06:05.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂我的意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.36,0:06:09.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.64,0:06:17.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了  慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. All right, take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.50,0:06:20.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  送你到这里  接下来自己能行吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you're good to make it from here, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.08,0:06:23.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里  在急救室不要提恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Jeffrey, no demon talk in the E.R.,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.86,0:06:24.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:26.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被打劫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were mugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.67,0:06:29.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.27,0:06:33.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.41,0:06:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(爱达荷州  科达伦)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.42,0:06:41.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(现在)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:55.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,机密服务器\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Classified server"?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.39,0:06:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是德弗罗吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got to be Devereaux, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.87,0:07:00.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.98,0:07:02.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.59,0:07:04.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗兰克  弗兰克  有什么消息告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank, Frank, what do you got for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.25,0:07:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这地方不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.24,0:07:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有点像是男洗手间加了几张床\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of like a men's room with beds.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.85,0:07:14.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鳄梨垢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, avocado grime.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:20.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要用好几年才能长成这样的薄片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes years to build up a patina like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:24.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找不到他是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you can't find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.98,0:07:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可是迪克·罗曼  看新闻联播就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Dick Roman. Turn on CNN.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:29.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见他参加菲尼克斯的记者招待会了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you see him at that, uh, press conference in Phoenix?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.99,0:07:31.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那混蛋到处跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bastard's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.72,0:07:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.97,0:07:38.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I-I-I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.47,0:07:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不在乎他们是否渗透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care that they've infiltrated
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.81,0:07:43.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,豪华游艇产业  弗兰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}the luxury-boat industry, Frank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.55,0:07:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啊  给卡内(美国说唱歌手)打电话吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Call Kanye.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.65,0:07:48.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,弗兰克还在查罗曼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frank's still stumped on Roman?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.13,0:07:49.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.66,0:07:51.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  开始干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:53.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  看这些死者的档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, look at the victim profiles --
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.61,0:07:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的年龄  发色  身形\N{\fnArial\fs30}same age, same hair color, body type.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.96,0:07:59.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仪式中毁尸的方式是一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The ritual mutilations line up exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.04,0:08:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,底下谁会把咱们这些小恶魔放出来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who down there would've let our demon out of the can?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.91,0:08:05.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他告了他上司的密  我们确保了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He squealed on his superiors. We made sure of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.65,0:08:08.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他得等到小号节才能放出来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, he should be down under until, uh, trumpet day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.54,0:08:11.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但过去两周有两个女人被杀  丢失同样身体部位\N{\fnArial\fs30}But two women killed in the last two weeks, same parts missing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:12.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且连他们被杀的地点都没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, same old hunting grounds, even.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.29,0:08:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们可以过去看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, well, we can take a swing at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.55,0:08:17.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你得知道现在咱们的重点在利维坦啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know it's all about the Leviathans now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们才是我们最应该被猎杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the ones we need to be hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.64,0:08:23.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  但不行  现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but, no -- I mean, not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.73,0:08:25.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个是咱们的事  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one's ours, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.59,0:08:27.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这显然是咱们当时活没做干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unfinished business, apparently.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.71,0:08:29.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.00,0:08:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是32队  重复一遍  是32队\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is unit 32. Repeat, unit 32.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.87,0:08:36.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又发现一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got another one,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.48,0:08:37.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在187号公路上 \N{\fnArial\fs30}at 187.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.99,0:08:41.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,白人女性  快四十岁  在亨利自主干洗店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Femail, caucasian, maybe late 30s, at the Henley Autowash.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.77,0:08:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,32队  增援马上就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unit 32, assistance is en route.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.58,0:08:46.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里很不堪  调度中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a real mess here, dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.78,0:08:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每次咱们这么干\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, every time we do this, 
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.71,0:08:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都在想  会不会就在今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder if today's the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.84,0:09:00.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走过去  向一堆装成警察的大嘴怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We walk up, flash our tin to a bunch of chompers
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.07,0:09:01.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,亮了徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}pretending to be policemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.61,0:09:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有同感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.98,0:09:04.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就说你们俩会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you guys might show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.23,0:09:10.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是那对好搭档  你们是鲍汉姆探员...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the Drummer Boys. Agents, uh, Bonham...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.40,0:09:11.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和沃茨探员  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Watts, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.73,0:09:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.24,0:09:13.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  就是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.87,0:09:16.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴再次见到你  警探...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, it's a pleasure to see you again, Detective...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.95,0:09:18.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-萨顿  -不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sutton. - You know what? Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.61,0:09:21.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, what was it -- Detective...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.29,0:09:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是萨顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.47,0:09:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没关系  我是萨顿警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no problemo, Detective Sutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.60,0:09:25.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sutton.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.47,0:09:27.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨顿  对  你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sutton, yeah. Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.63,0:09:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真不想这么说  但案子看来又重开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sad to say, case looks to be open again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.23,0:09:32.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.38,0:09:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的工具\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.80,0:09:39.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同样的伤口  一样疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same cuts. Same crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.77,0:09:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,倒也说得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:44.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟我们上次没能抓住这杂种  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, we didn't catch the critter last time, did we?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.73,0:09:47.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有嫌疑犯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no suspects?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:48.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.88,0:09:50.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得十分缜密\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very thorough.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.15,0:09:52.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很冷血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cold-blooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.41,0:09:57.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  警探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, detective.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.50,0:09:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随时效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.31,0:10:12.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.03,0:10:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.00,0:10:15.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最好去看看海夫洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better go check on Havelock.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.83,0:10:16.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.17,0:10:25.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,Wiccansweb.com\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wiccansweb.com.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:26.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,网店而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Internet mail order.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.46,0:10:30.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是些小把戏  草药  护身符啥的\N{\fnArial\fs30}White magic only herbs and talismans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.80,0:10:37.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是小把戏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.40,0:10:39.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点  油漆还没干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, it's still drying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.09,0:10:42.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在警局里有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a friend at the sheriff's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:45.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道那些最近的谋杀案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know about all the new murders.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我尽可能的保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing what I can to protect myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.93,0:10:53.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还翻译了一些很古老的驱逐魔咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm also translating some very old banishments.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.53,0:11:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些...这些很不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, uh, these are -- these are good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.33,0:11:04.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  我现在熟络了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. I've got an affinity.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.79,0:11:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但当时  在农舍的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}But back then, that night in that farmhouse,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.52,0:11:08.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时管了自己管不了的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in over my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.59,0:11:09.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在知道了  相信我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that now, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.62,0:11:11.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会把那活留给你们这样的专业人士的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will leave all that to the pros.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.64,0:11:13.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你帮我们找到了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you helped track it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.70,0:11:15.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可跑了不少腿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it was some solid legwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.29,0:11:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真遇上情况  我其实就只知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it came down to it, all I really knew
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.64,0:11:18.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该去给谁打电话  让他问来\N{\fnArial\fs30}was somebody who knew somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.74,0:11:20.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该去找谁要管事的人的号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knew the right number to call.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:22.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对了  你们现在的号码打不通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your number is not working, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.27,0:11:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我们遇到些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, we, uh, we've had
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.53,0:11:26.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,技术问题  电话有毛病\N{\fnArial\fs30}some technical difficulties -- phone issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.71,0:11:28.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真是个很大的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a monster problem, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.47,0:11:32.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么你有接触到什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, you haven't had any contact?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.68,0:11:36.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接触恶魔吗  没有  谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the demon? No, thank god.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.73,0:11:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在这还有些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one or two things to finish in town,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.65,0:11:39.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,处理完后我就离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.75,0:11:41.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,做得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.43,0:11:45.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们找到杰弗里了吗  -谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you found Jeffrey yet? - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.07,0:11:48.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个当时被恶魔附身的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man who the demon possessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.57,0:11:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个你们差点打死的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one you almost beat to death.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.26,0:11:53.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对啊  杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Jeffrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.93,0:11:55.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那可怜的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That poor bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.08,0:11:58.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有些恶魔比较感情用事  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some demons tend to be sentimental, don't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.15,0:12:01.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果可以总是喜欢附身同一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always go back to the same host if they can.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.55,0:12:07.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想说说电影频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to talk about Cinemax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.81,0:12:09.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都是成年人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're grown men.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们付房租  为什么不能有电影频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We pay rent. Why can't we get Cinemax?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.83,0:12:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毛片频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skinemax.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.06,0:12:16.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,中止项目的顾问已经谈过这个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The halfway program advisers have already weighed in on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.60,0:12:17.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行  行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.88,0:12:19.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-集体提议也不能...  -我都说行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bringing it up in group is not gon-- - I said fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.20,0:12:23.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.29,0:12:25.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今早晚些时候你也有新闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have some pretty big going down later this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.94,0:12:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, I guess. 
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.52,0:12:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我今天要去接她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I'm picking her up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.03,0:12:33.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是条狗  我打算养条救生犬\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm getting a dog -- a rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.94,0:12:36.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得我为她喷雾  注射疫苗等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to get her spayed and shots and stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.28,0:12:38.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们说她已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but they said she's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:41.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里和我谈过这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey and I talked about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.17,0:12:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他明白养宠物是特权\N{\fnArial\fs30}He understands that pet ownership is a privilege,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.95,0:12:45.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是普通权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a right.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.33,0:12:47.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他要向组织里所有的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna have to show the whole house
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:49.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,证明自己能担起责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he can handle the responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.18,0:12:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我这么做的意义  对吧  艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what it's all about, right, Alan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,担起责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.77,0:12:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay there? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,手术很搞笑吧  是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surgery's a bucket of laughs, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.33,0:13:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看上去挺好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉要给你戴上这个傻气的圆锥套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry for the cone of shame,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.59,0:13:06.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们得防止针脚裂开\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we got to keep these stitches in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.29,0:13:10.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.20,0:13:13.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.29,0:13:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是杰弗里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.20,0:13:45.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杰弗里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.55,0:13:48.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  好了  你没事了  没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Look, it's okay. You're okay, you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.84,0:13:49.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.13,0:13:51.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是为了确认下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just had to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:54.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确认什么  确认我今天尿裤子了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure of what -- that I peed my pants today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.01,0:14:01.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吓到我的狗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, you scared my dog.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.02,0:14:03.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们本来不想吓到它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, we did not want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.79,0:14:06.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  杰弗  我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Jeff, we got to, uh, we got to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.49,0:14:13.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.89,0:14:15.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.05,0:14:20.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你一定过得很艰难\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know it must've been, um, hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.06,0:14:24.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你听到自己说了什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even listen to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.27,0:14:28.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, don't bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.27,0:14:31.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们找我什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you guys want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.72,0:14:35.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在确定那个附身过你的恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, um, we're pretty sure the demon that possessed you...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.82,0:14:38.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:41.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.36,0:14:45.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把他驱逐了  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You exorcised him, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.37,0:14:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他...他应该在地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's -- he's supposed to be in hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.97,0:14:52.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里  冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey, look, please just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.22,0:14:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请你坐下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just have a seat, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.00,0:14:55.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.87,0:14:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去两周又有三位女性遭到谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three more women have been murdered over the past two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.68,0:14:59.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.15,0:15:02.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被害者的调查文件和法医鉴定结果都一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same vic profiles, same forensics.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.76,0:15:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,作案现场有硫磺粉末\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crime scene dusted with sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.53,0:15:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不得不假定是他干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to assume that it's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.94,0:15:07.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're here now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.72,0:15:08.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他来追你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if he comes after you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会像上次一样困住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll nail him just like we did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.85,0:15:13.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他杀的最后一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The last one he killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.21,0:15:17.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安娜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是安娜·帕克斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anna Paxton.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.62,0:15:23.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马乔丽·威利斯  她是名单里下一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marjorie Willis. She's the next one on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.72,0:15:25.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,名单  什么名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}List? What list?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.16,0:15:27.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个恶魔从前常念叨一份名单\N{\fnArial\fs30}The demon used to recite it all the time, 
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.71,0:15:29.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像背购物单一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a grocery list.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.12,0:15:31.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那名单印在我脑海里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He burned it in my head --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.37,0:15:33.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是所有他要杀害女人的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}the names of all the women he was gonna kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.91,0:15:35.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经选定受害者了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He already had his victims chosen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.70,0:15:38.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还排好了顺序\N{\fnArial\fs30}And put in a line, and in an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.60,0:15:39.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.04,0:15:42.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔不怎么喜欢那种狂热的连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demons aren't usually into the obsessive serial-killer crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.68,0:15:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们更喜欢多种方式作恶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, they're more just kind of all-around evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.68,0:15:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.13,0:15:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说这就是他的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said it was his job.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.34,0:16:02.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里  你的客人登记了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey, did your, uh, guests sign in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.17,0:16:04.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很抱歉  艾伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm really sorry, Alan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.61,0:16:08.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是我还在邮局时认识的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're friends of mine from my days back at the post office.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.12,0:16:09.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道他们要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know they were coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.17,0:16:10.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.12,0:16:13.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们给这可怜的混蛋帮了倒忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think we really helped mess this poor son of a bitch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:17.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看  他就跟有个公派的保镖一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him. He's got a state-assigned dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.45,0:16:20.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  让他们登记离开的时候再签个到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, just get them to sign in when they sign out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.65,0:16:27.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里  我要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, Jeffrey, look, I'm gonna go,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.77,0:16:29.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要去找马乔丽·威利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}uh, I'm gonna go find Marjorie Willis, 
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.25,0:16:30.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,暗中保护她  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}keep her on watch, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:32.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.14,0:16:34.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就留在这里  以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna stay here just in case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.38,0:16:47.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.42,0:16:55.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说的没错  现在人都不看书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. We just don't read anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.21,0:16:59.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,马乔丽·威利斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marjorie Willis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.08,0:17:03.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是图书管理员和室内园艺爱好者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Librarian, indoor gardening enthusiast,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.24,0:17:05.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也是恶魔的下一位器官捐赠者\N{\fnArial\fs30}our demon's next organ donor.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:31.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山姆  拜托和我说说话   都几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam, talk to me. It's been months.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.64,0:17:40.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们把我留在急诊室时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you left me at the ER, 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.85,0:17:43.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我断了三根手指\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had three smashed fingers,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.43,0:17:46.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,少了五颗牙  断了手腕  鼻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}five teeth out, a broken wrist, nose, 
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:48.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,颧骨和锁骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}cheekbone, collarbone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.85,0:17:51.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还缝了160针\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to get 160 stitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.54,0:17:52.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,被抢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mugged.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.58,0:17:55.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,值班医生说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor on duty said it looked like
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.73,0:17:57.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我像被西班牙宗教法庭审过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got caught in the Spanish Inquisition.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.63,0:17:59.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.08,0:18:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总的来说他们把我治好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They patched me up, mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.84,0:18:05.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我丢了工作和健康保险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I lost my job, my health insurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.29,0:18:10.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始酗酒  漂泊  迷失自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just started to drink and drift, and I got lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.22,0:18:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都有一点精神崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had some kind of mental break.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.92,0:18:18.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后我开始和人交流  聊了聊发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I started to talk... about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.43,0:18:23.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哥们  别说  永远  都别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, man. Never tell. Never...never.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.80,0:18:26.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在知道了  相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that now, believe me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.37,0:18:27.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我猜猜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.30,0:18:32.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从酒池子里到心理评估再到72小时强制拘留\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drunk tank to psych eval to 72-hour forced hold
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.10,0:18:35.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最后是他们随便选择一个机构把你关在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}to a nice long stay at an institution of their choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.54,0:18:37.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.41,0:18:40.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我朋友们就是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happened to friends of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.69,0:18:43.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很长一段时间  我都不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a long time, I didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.63,0:18:46.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真相要比我在哪重要得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth was more important than where I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.72,0:18:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我完全无法应付外面的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in no shape to cope with the outside world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.23,0:18:52.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey, you got out, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,振作起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holding it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:56.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而现在恶魔却回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now the demon is back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:00.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很遗憾  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:04.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说真的  对你的种种遭遇深表遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean it-- about all of it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:07.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你救了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.06,0:19:10.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我欠你的  我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you for it. I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.42,0:19:13.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有很多人帮忙  我现在才振作起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe a lot of people for getting even this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.13,0:19:15.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.43,0:19:20.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.39,0:19:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.78,0:19:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他还没有盯上下一个女人  马乔丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he isn't already circling the next woman, Marjorie,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.11,0:19:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我...我可能知道他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}than I- I think I might know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.82,0:19:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有一个特别的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had this special place
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.72,0:19:35.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用来存放他藏匿地的纪念品\N{\fnArial\fs30}where he kept souvenirs where he nested.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:37.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么没告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell us this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.04,0:19:38.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.75,0:19:40.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不必去  我们会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to go. We'll handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.54,0:19:42.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去  我必须得去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.12,0:19:47.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"平均年降雨量  朴树  德州..."\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Average annual rainfall-- hackberry, Texas..."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.16,0:20:26.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  萨姆  关注我一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sam, pay attention to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.27,0:20:27.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我好无聊哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.48,0:20:39.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,内战迷吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Civil War buff?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.34,0:20:49.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可恶  没信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it-- no service.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.23,0:20:55.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好孩子  你待在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good girl. You stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.41,0:20:57.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里有些牛肉干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's some jerky.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.37,0:21:01.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,乖乖待着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.66,0:21:05.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它不会在这里撒尿的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thing's not gonna pee in here, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.17,0:21:07.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.97,0:21:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他带你到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, he'd get you this far,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.16,0:21:20.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后就不让你看了  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then he'd shut your lights out, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.26,0:21:24.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知为何  他对这地方一直遮遮掩掩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}For some reason, he was very secretive about this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.96,0:21:26.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但过了一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.18,0:21:29.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只在我们走进去的时候才遮住我的双眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd only really sort of cover my eyes when we walked in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:31.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得你能带我们回到那里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you think you can get us back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.80,0:21:42.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在我的这些停产期刊里干我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here in my discontinued periodicals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.88,0:21:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.79,0:22:02.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走廊尽头的红色门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red door down the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.46,0:22:05.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,的确有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.28,0:22:27.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定是这里没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.55,0:22:45.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,待在这  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, stay over here. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.37,0:22:47.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就待在这  别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just stay here. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.69,0:23:05.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.41,0:23:33.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Hey, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.69,0:23:34.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会把你救出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get you out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.12,0:23:38.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会伤害你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, I'm not gonna hurt you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.37,0:23:39.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你别乱动\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you got to stay still.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.39,0:23:54.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很肯定这人喜欢无聊的胖妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure this guy's the boring sort of chubby chaser.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.27,0:24:01.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,留下你的姓名  电话  以及梦魇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave your name, number, and nightmare at the tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.33,0:24:04.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你在哪  我这里一无所获\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, where are you? I'm scoping zero out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.31,0:24:08.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是什么好兆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a good sign.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.06,0:24:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你居然还没注意到  真让我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surprised you haven't picked up on that yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.44,0:24:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在  法医报告里\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's right... there in the coroner's report.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.42,0:24:32.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在最近的一件谋杀案中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this latest round of killings, our big girls
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.54,0:24:35.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,警察在死者血液中发现了大量镇定剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}had traces of heavy tranquilizers in their blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.90,0:24:38.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们的恶魔很强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but our demon's strong enough
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.29,0:24:40.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,足以让那些胖妞做任何他要求的事  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}to make fat Betty do whatever he wants to, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.06,0:24:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他为什么会需要镇定剂呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why does he need the tranqs?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.38,0:24:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难道是他腿脚不行了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think he's got a bad back?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.29,0:24:48.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论这里发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever is going on here,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.06,0:24:51.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝不是恶魔回来杀人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know that demon's not coming back to kill anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.92,0:24:58.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是特别探员史密斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Special Agent Smith.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.24,0:24:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请留下您的姓名  电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please leave your name, number--
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.77,0:25:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了  迪恩的两只手机都打不通\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. That's every cellphone Dean's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.74,0:25:04.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,应该总有一个能接到的  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them should've picked up, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.76,0:25:06.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大哥哥也许已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big brother's probably dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.25,0:25:07.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.79,0:25:17.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他对我说"闭嘴"了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said "Shut up" to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.62,0:25:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我所说的  萨姆  重新真正地交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm talking about, Sam-- real interaction again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.60,0:25:26.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很想念这种互动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.44,0:25:29.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,语带机锋  像绕口令一样地吵架\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rapier wit, the wittier rape.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.29,0:25:31.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.37,0:25:34.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会乖乖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.33,0:25:37.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至会帮你解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll even help you solve
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.78,0:25:40.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.78,0:25:40.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那神探南茜(美国漫画人物)的谜案什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}your little Nancy Drew mystery or whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.53,0:25:44.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有便条\N{\fnArial\fs30}No note.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.69,0:25:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个手机扰频器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm, a cellphone scrambler.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.65,0:25:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但亲爱的  这些是违法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Luci, those are illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.07,0:25:55.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好好想想  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.26,0:25:58.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许这和迪恩的手机收不到信号有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe this has something to do with Dean's telephone blackout.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.56,0:26:37.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拉丁语  毫无可疑之处呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Latin-- not suspicious at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.16,0:26:39.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过这个咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen this spell before.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.42,0:26:42.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  但你见过这个类型的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. But you've seen this type.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.13,0:26:46.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔召唤咒  为什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Demon summoning-- why?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.56,0:26:48.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  为了召唤恶魔  蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? To summon a demon, jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.36,0:26:50.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始看是谁写的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start looking at who.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.99,0:26:56.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.80,0:26:58.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看这页纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the page.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.30,0:27:04.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你认识这个笔迹  -我认识这个笔迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know this handwriting. - I know this handwriting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.92,0:27:38.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咦  我的头真疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Iay, caramami cabeza!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.81,0:27:45.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺拉  停下  冷静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora, stop it! Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.63,0:27:47.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是什么  这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.97,0:27:51.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为何杰弗里手中有你手写的恶魔召唤咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did Jeffrey have a demon summoning in your handwriting?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.10,0:27:53.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切都按照他所说  他所计划的进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything's happening the way he said, the way he planned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.71,0:27:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么计划  -你帮不上忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What plan?! - You can't help --
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.26,0:27:57.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你改变不了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't change it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.67,0:27:58.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,逼供吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.18,0:28:03.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺拉  告诉我发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora, tell me what is going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.16,0:28:06.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆  搞定她  她知道迪恩出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, shake her up. She knows what happened to Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.02,0:28:08.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让这蠢妇专心思考  行不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get this stupid cow to focus, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.31,0:28:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诺拉  听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nora, listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.53,0:28:11.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不论你在怕什么  你现在应该更怕我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever it is, you should be a lot more scared of me right now
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.78,0:28:14.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我离你只有两英寸远  我能逼你开口\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm 2 inches away from you, and I can make you talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.50,0:28:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听明白了没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.09,0:28:21.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.76,0:28:25.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他绑架了我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.24,0:28:27.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你脑子在想什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.05,0:28:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当初怎么会想到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, why would you even
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.00,0:28:30.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要帮恶魔重返人间的\N{\fnArial\fs30}help bring back a demon in the first place?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.94,0:28:32.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没想召回恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not the demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.14,0:28:34.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.07,0:28:44.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.80,0:28:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  你醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. You're up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.26,0:28:52.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生了什么  出了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.36,0:28:54.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人请你来插手\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one asked you to get involved,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.03,0:28:57.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来救我  救任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}to save me, to save anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.31,0:28:59.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.16,0:29:03.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有没有想过也许我挺爱被恶魔附身的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever think that maybe I loved being possessed?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.82,0:29:04.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.17,0:29:08.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱那种联系  那种力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}I loved the connection, the power.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.02,0:29:10.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I loved him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.61,0:29:13.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实上  他是我此生挚爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love of my life, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.95,0:29:15.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你一定是在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.18,0:29:17.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他解放了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He liberated me --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.23,0:29:21.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,带我走向人生真正的使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}started me on my true life mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.42,0:29:23.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,原来是你杀了那些女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're the one with the thing for all those women.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.55,0:29:25.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吗  杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you, Jeffrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.01,0:29:29.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是个连环杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a serial killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.81,0:29:31.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他找上我之前  我一文不值\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was nothing before he found me --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.29,0:29:35.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像一道影子  害怕完成自己使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}A shadow too scared to do what I was brought here to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.08,0:29:39.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害怕展现自己真实的潜力\N{\fnArial\fs30}too timid to live up to my true potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.19,0:29:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what happened --
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.55,0:29:45.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红发魔鬼让你吃饱穿暖了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Redheaded mommy make you stuff birds, put on dresses?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.03,0:29:48.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不应该无视他人的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't trivialize other people's pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.98,0:29:50.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  就让魔鬼进驻  \N{\fnArial\fs30}So, demon comes along, 
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.85,0:29:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你脑海中协同指挥\N{\fnArial\fs30}rides co-pilot in your skull...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.19,0:29:54.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,教你怎样杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}teaches you how to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.35,0:29:59.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个名单  是你拟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The list... that's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.43,0:30:02.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,多少年来  这只是个我玩的游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}For years, it was just a game I would play.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.51,0:30:06.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每当我在街上与某人擦肩而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I'd walk by one of them in the street
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.02,0:30:08.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者在邮递路上看到某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}or see one on my mail route...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.68,0:30:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她们的脑海里总会发出一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's a sound that comes from their brains.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.51,0:30:14.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.83,0:30:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有我能听见  就像邪恶的汽笛声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only I can hear it, like an evil, little steam whistle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.56,0:30:23.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,每当我遇上一个  我就会跟踪她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time I saw one, I'd follow her,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.84,0:30:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记录下她的地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}take down her address.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.79,0:30:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不会做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was never gonna do anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.83,0:30:34.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在他出现之前不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}not till he came along.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.53,0:30:37.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是我的救星\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the one who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.35,0:30:40.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而你却将他打回地狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you sent him to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.74,0:30:44.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,驱魔之后  我一直严密监视杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I kept tabs on Jeffrey after the exorcism.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.89,0:30:47.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至在医院给他发过护理包\N{\fnArial\fs30}I even sent him care packages in the hospital,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.23,0:30:48.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他从来没回应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he never responded.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.73,0:30:50.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不久以前  他来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then not long ago, he came to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.17,0:30:54.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他看起来很健康  精神正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seemed healthy, put together, except he wanted to know
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.75,0:30:56.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他知道是否有重新召回恶魔的方法\N{\fnArial\fs30}if there was a way to summon the demon back.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.00,0:30:58.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说他已经做了一些调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he'd been doing some research.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.68,0:31:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分都是废话  但他坚信那是可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was mostly nonsense, but he was convinced it was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.68,0:31:04.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还真打开了她的话匣子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really knocked the cork out of her piehole.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.85,0:31:05.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把他打发走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.09,0:31:09.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让他去找其他帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told him to get some more help.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.40,0:31:10.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,第二天\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next day
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.77,0:31:12.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他给我打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}he called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.52,0:31:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我儿子和我说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}He put my son on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.91,0:31:20.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他把他从宿舍绑架走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had taken him from his dorm room.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.33,0:31:23.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我向他交待了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave him everything --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.34,0:31:26.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所需的仪式和魔符\N{\fnArial\fs30}the ritual, the sigils.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.36,0:31:29.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他还是不放我儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he kept my boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.98,0:31:35.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后他寄给我这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he sent me this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.10,0:31:43.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是我宝贝儿子的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my baby's ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.00,0:31:47.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仪式没成功  所以他割下我儿子的耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He cut it off because the ritual didn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.14,0:31:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个恶魔交待了一些绝对机密对信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That demon gave up some serious state secrets --
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:53.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在他肯定被严密控制着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would've gone into big lockdown now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.24,0:31:54.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想召唤他出来可不容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so easy to bring him back up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.96,0:31:56.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jeffrey didn't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.51,0:31:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他让我找到失败的原因  否则要我好看\N{\fnArial\fs30}He told me to find out what went wrong or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.91,0:32:02.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于  我找到了一条肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Finally, I found a summoning spell
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.42,0:32:04.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能成功的召唤咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}that would work for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.63,0:32:11.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,之后  他说我还有另一项任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's when he said I had another job to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.14,0:32:14.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which was what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.36,0:32:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当你们到来后  我得把你们引向杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you came, I was supposed to send you to Jeffrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.76,0:32:20.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他用尸体引路  确保你们会被吸引来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He left a trail of bodies to make sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.28,0:32:24.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"驱魔人之血"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Blood of the exorcist"?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.07,0:32:26.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是我见过最强的召唤咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strongest summoning I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.43,0:32:30.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,需要当初放逐魔鬼的驱魔人的血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requires the blood of the exorcist who banished him --
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.14,0:32:31.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人就是你哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.25,0:32:33.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.92,0:32:35.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都在杰弗里计划之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is all part of Jeffrey's plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.18,0:32:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  好了  新计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well...new plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.26,0:32:42.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追踪咒  不管是巴伐利亚式还是埃及式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tracking spell -- Bavarian, Egyptian.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.09,0:32:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不在乎  你来选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care -- dealer's choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.93,0:32:47.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,用被追踪人的肉体来找到他和迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the flesh of the body to find the body and Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.96,0:32:51.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想留着这耳朵  还是你儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want the ear or the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.23,0:32:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你吓得我毛骨悚然\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're giving me the chills.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.24,0:33:03.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想我挺了解你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like to think I know you pretty well.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.91,0:33:05.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  你怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, how do you figure?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.55,0:33:09.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看着你折磨无辜者  逼出恶魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I watched you torture an innocent man to get out a demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.02,0:33:14.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,场面惊心动魄  很能反映人性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty charged situation... revealing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.06,0:33:19.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们夸夸其谈  展现出了很多个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys talked about a lot, showed a lot of character.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.13,0:33:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}God...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.74,0:33:26.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你绞尽脑汁想要拯救这个世界	\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were so desperate to fix the world back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.35,0:33:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而人们又在不断遭受痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It kills you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.56,0:33:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这几乎让你生不如死\N{\fnArial\fs30}that people keep getting hurt...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.41,0:33:36.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你对此又无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you just can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.08,0:33:42.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不是应该说你已经生不如死了  是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or I should say it's killed you, shouldn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.39,0:33:46.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.02,0:33:49.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时在场啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.42,0:33:56.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是那么的绝望  迪恩  因为他离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was depressed, Dean, because he was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.92,0:34:02.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就像一具没有灵魂的残骸  一个醉鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a wreck, an emotional shell, a drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.31,0:34:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至自杀过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was suicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.81,0:34:07.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,通常我不推荐别人自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't usually endorse suicide,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.59,0:34:09.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是老兄  为什么你没成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}but man, what stopped you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.08,0:34:13.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为大楼里的艾伦阻止了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was Alan at the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.18,0:34:14.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.85,0:34:17.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他真的是一名很好的精神康复医师	\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a really good rehab therapist.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.30,0:34:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我重新认识到了我的目标  端正了我的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really helped me focus on my goals, my attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.90,0:34:24.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不得不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.43,0:34:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确实从他的疗程中获益匪浅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really benefited from the whole program.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.07,0:34:31.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个人的幸福生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}A life well-lived
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.41,0:34:35.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来源于对真正快乐的不懈追求\N{\fnArial\fs30}comes from the structured pursuit of meaningful happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.08,0:34:40.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我认识到如果没有恶魔  我什么也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized I was nothing without my demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.87,0:34:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因此我决定让他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I decided I have to get him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.04,0:34:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.92,0:34:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝贝儿  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, there, honey. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.65,0:35:02.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我承认  这菜谱确实有点恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bitch of a recipe, I must admit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.47,0:35:05.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.90,0:35:09.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这狗娘养的变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you sick son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.41,0:36:21.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Jeffrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.79,0:36:33.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩·温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.66,0:36:36.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}As I live and breathe...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.66,0:36:39.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回到了这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.68,0:36:45.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.60,0:36:47.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在感谢你呢  杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thanking you, Jeffrey.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.98,0:36:55.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么附身在这半死的躯体上\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing with this half-dead piece of crap?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.95,0:36:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come into me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.78,0:37:00.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们度过了一段很美妙的时光  是吗  杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had a very special time together, didn't we, Jeffrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.03,0:37:03.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得我教你的东西  多么令人欣慰啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It warms my heart to see you haven't forgotten what I taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.75,0:37:05.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你学以致用\N{\fnArial\fs30}You built on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.32,0:37:08.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓到了一个温彻斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You captured a Winchester.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.79,0:37:13.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里你是我的好学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, Jeffrey...my pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.83,0:37:17.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想当你的学生  我想成为你的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to be your pupil. I want to be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.37,0:37:20.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我不需要你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.58,0:37:23.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的任务完成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My work is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.59,0:37:27.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在可以自由地想干嘛干嘛去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do everything now, all on your beautiful own.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.30,0:37:29.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.45,0:37:30.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.51,0:37:41.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的字典里没有"不"  记得吗  杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't do "No." Remember, Jeffrey?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.76,0:37:47.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,继续锯你的绳子吧  累了记得休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep sawing away at your ropes, Penelope Pitstop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.64,0:37:50.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你喜欢  我可以解开它跟你跳舞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can dance standing up if you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.43,0:37:52.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is this what you do --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.42,0:37:55.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让好好的一个的邮递员变成疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}find postal workers, make 'em go postal?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.67,0:37:58.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是稍微指点了下而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talent scout. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.66,0:38:01.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在他们下地狱之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking for the next generation of superstars...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.91,0:38:05.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就发觉了他们的潜力  比如杰弗里\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they get to hell, like Jeffrey here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.80,0:38:12.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他有着所有的潜质  如同瓶子里的泡泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had all the raw material... just bubbling in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.57,0:38:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要做的只是简单的打开瓶口\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I had to do was loosen the lid on his jar,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.53,0:38:18.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,简单的做几个示范\N{\fnArial\fs30}show him some practical know-how.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.43,0:38:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那这个孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what about the kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.92,0:38:22.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.80,0:38:25.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有前途\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.07,0:38:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有什么用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.86,0:38:30.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有潜质\N{\fnArial\fs30}No natural gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.73,0:38:35.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我或许会在去拉斯维加斯的路上毁掉这个躯壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll probably burn this meat off on my way to Vegas.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.65,0:38:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真他妈见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to be kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.50,0:39:00.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let go of my son!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.59,0:39:03.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们是哪儿冒出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do you keep coming from?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.96,0:39:17.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咒语\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exorcizamus te, omnis immundus spiritus.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.62,0:39:20.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会回来的  黑暗式的回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be back, you know. Back in black.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.53,0:39:22.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,下地狱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.46,0:39:24.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.00,0:39:27.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.57,0:39:33.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[咒语]
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.41,0:39:45.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.76,0:39:49.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.12,0:39:52.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事了孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got you, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.89,0:40:02.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.98,0:40:08.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杰弗里只是假装成受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Jeffrey was just pretending to be the victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.82,0:40:11.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在农场房子里面的那场驱魔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way back in that farmhouse during the exorcism,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.83,0:40:15.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是在演戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}he-he was just...acting.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.21,0:40:18.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他是个精神病  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a psychopath, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.65,0:40:22.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们最常干的是就是演戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what they do all the time, is act.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.00,0:40:24.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装的自己是个正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Act like they're normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.56,0:40:27.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,装的他们不是那么疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Act like they're not balls-to-the-wall crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.78,0:40:30.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要睡觉了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You going to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.38,0:40:33.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,废话  去他妈的良心  这就是我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn straight. Screw consciousness, that's what I say.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.54,0:40:41.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  萨姆  你可不能睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, Sam. No nap for you, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.63,0:40:45.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得了吧  别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on, don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.28,0:40:49.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们谈谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's talk, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.97,0:40:52.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直非常喜欢我们的小对话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always enjoyed our special little chats.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.49,0:40:53.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不想谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you want to talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.35,0:40:57.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.14,0:40:59.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情肯定有所不同了  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something's definitely different now, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.13,0:41:03.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你让我进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.53,0:41:06.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要我  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted me, partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.72,0:41:08.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在你以为还能用你小小的伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think you can use your little tricks
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.85,0:41:10.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再一次放逐我吗  不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}to banish me again like that? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.37,0:41:13.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我确信我搞定你了  小伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe I've got you, bunk buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.67,0:41:17.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看我怎么用我的小魔术搅和你的思想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got my finger wiggling around in your brainpan.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.48,0:41:28.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧  小萨姆  来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Sammy! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.45,0:41:30.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跟我一起说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say it with me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:31.33,0:41:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,早安  越南\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Vietnam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,
